rio et ouvrent le paquet récompense Le\ncœur de la Plante !"}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.9,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/722209"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/722209"}]},{"id":"3520","name":"Yzma - Créée par la Plante","number":"7","subtitle":"Spécial","image":"https://api.lorcana.ravensburger.com/images/fr/quest3/7_ad7f400d4207d77be8e4e46b0bf9be1885197dcd.jpg","thumb":"https://api.lorcana.ravensburger.com/images/fr/quest3/7_8486c23d6d91e6e842cea74c954f20fd91b9fc6e.jpg","details":[["set","Quête des Illumineurs: Équipe Miel à la rescousse"],["number","7 · Q3"],["rarity","Spécial"],["type","Personnage"],["cost",6],["inkwell","✓"],["strength",3],["willpower",6],["lore",2],["subTypes","Floodborn • Mage • Pousse"],["illustrator","Alice Pisoni"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"CROISSANCE ACCÉLÉRÉE Lorsque la Plante joue\nce personnage, elle crée une Liane pour chaque\nIllumineur."},{"titleKey":"flavor","body":"« Toute aussi intimidante que l'originale. »"}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":1.1,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":1,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":1.1,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/722244"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/722244"}]},{"id":"3521","name":"Kronk - Créé par la Plante","number":"8","subtitle":"Spécial","image":"https://api.lorcana.ravensburger.com/images/fr/quest3/8_ccd681d0ec1da4800d0c17e3ceccc45a5f344dd4.jpg","thumb":"https://api.lorcana.ravensburger.com/images/fr/quest3/8_3268f9c2ba16717de60e57a9f836c5eeda97dea3.jpg","details":[["set","Quête des Illumineurs: Équipe Miel à la rescousse"],["number","8 · Q3"],["rarity","Spécial"],["type","Personnage"],["cost",6],["inkwell","✓"],["strength",3],["willpower",8],["lore",1],["subTypes","Floodborn • Pousse"],["illustrator","Serena Wade"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"JUSTE UNE SECONDE Ce personnage entre en jeu épuisé.\nÇA DOIT FAIRE MAL Lorsque la Plante joue ce personnage,\nelle inflige 1 dommage à chaque personnage adverse.\nRempart (Lorsqu'il défie l'un des personnages de la Plante,\nun personnage adverse doit, s'il le peut, choisir un personnage\navec Rempart.)"}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":1.73,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":1.5,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":1.73,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/722263"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/722263"}]},{"id":"3522","name":"Flynn Rider - Créé par la Plante","number":"9","subtitle":"Spécial","image":"https://api.lorcana.ravensburger.com/images/fr/quest3/9_ecb9dab11a4cadd812e5138fbf5728a554682a23.jpg","thumb":"https://api.lorcana.ravensburger.com/images/fr/quest3/9_c59172cba6bb82913cfde505381f57ccf1745a8b.jpg","details":[["set","Quête des Illumineurs: Équipe Miel à la rescousse"],["number","9 · Q3"],["rarity","Spécial"],["type","Personnage"],["cost",5],["inkwell","✓"],["strength",4],["willpower",3],["lore",2],["subTypes","Floodborn • Prince • Pousse"],["illustrator","Diogo Saito"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Insaisissable (Seuls les personnages avec\nInsaisissable peuvent défier ce personnage.)\nPERTE AMÈRE Lorsque la Plante joue ce personnage,\nchaque Illumineur perd 2 éclats de Lore."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":1.74,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":1.5,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":1.74,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/722265"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/722265"}]},{"id":"3523","name":"Brute de ronces - Protège la tige","number":"10","subtitle":"Spécial","image":"https://api.lorcana.ravensburger.com/images/fr/quest3/10_dd85a0687e9ca9b6f1c977223837ba39a4846310.jpg","thumb":"https://api.lorcana.ravensburger.com/images/fr/quest3/10_88f4aee46bf1ed012d1d5d278357cf3ed774e504.jpg","details":[["set","Quête des Illumineurs: Équipe Miel à la rescousse"],["number","10 · Q3"],["rarity","Spécial"],["type","Personnage"],["cost",7],["inkwell","✓"],["strength",7],["willpower",8],["lore",3],["subTypes","Pousse"],["illustrator","Max Grecke"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"DEMI-TOUR Lorsque la Plante joue ce personnage,\nbannissez tous les personnages adverses coûtant 3\nou moins."},{"titleKey":"flavor","body":"« Un rire sec, comme un murmure, emplit l'air. Ce n'est\npas une pousse de la Plante comme les autres. »"}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.5,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/709875"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/709875"}]},{"id":"3524","name":"Germe de la Plante - Tranchante","number":"11","subtitle":"Spécial","image":"https://api.lorcana.ravensburger.com/images/fr/quest3/11_49036d5bb3b324105cf51a62f92f03ff73f86932.jpg","thumb":"https://api.lorcana.ravensburger.com/images/fr/quest3/11_1dc895fff1aa225396ab6a62737b862063375321.jpg","details":[["set","Quête des Illumineurs: Équipe Miel à la rescousse"],["number","11 · Q3"],["rarity","Spécial"],["type","Personnage"],["cost",1],["inkwell","✓"],["strength",4],["willpower",2],["lore",1],["subTypes","Pousse"],["illustrator","\"Yano\" / L. Giammichele"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"flavor","body":"« “Je n'avais jamais vu une plante faire ça auparavant !\nVous pensez qu'elle connaît d'autres tours ?”\n—Tigrou, Barbare mellifique »"}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.49,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/722274"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/722274"}]},{"id"